The merged theorem currently records the safe round conclusion

\[
\liminf {q-k\over D}\ge 1.82515.
\]

Its own hostile audit and exact certificate already prove the stronger endpoint sign

\[
H_{50}(1.82516)>0,
\]

together with strict monotonicity

